  "bodyHash": "qLI/bwJrqyU=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 根據訪談，多位受訪者堅稱他們目擊了「屍體復活並攻擊他人」，甚至有人聲稱看到「死鳥在空中飛翔」。前一天，疾病管制局發言人仍堅稱所謂的「殭屍攻擊」純屬無稽之談，不過是看太多電影後的幻覺，並持續建議民眾待在家中，且有效藥物仍在臨床試驗階段。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 然而，大量民眾仍陷入恐慌，紛紛駕車撤離感染城鎮與州郡，導致嚴重交通堵塞。截至撰稿時，總統已簽署總統令，宣布全國進入軍事管制狀態。</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 史上最完整（開玩笑的）！求生者裝備與物資清單！立即開始學習如何抵禦殭屍大軍，並準備屬於你的求生包吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此模組提供一系列在殭屍末日中生存的工具，包含武器、防具、醫療用品等。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此外，模組亦提供多種素材，讓模組包的作者能修改物品的合成配方，使模組包更具現代感，同時無需引入複雜的科技模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eJEYhZooBik\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/86/2023-12-05_10.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"984\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">警告：從 1.6 版本開始，此模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a> 作為前置依賴，且從 2.0 beta 版本開始，需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sona-survival-101\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sona Survival 101</a> 作為前置依賴，部分物品 ID 已變更，請於更新前備份您的存檔！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillager's Gun</a>，掠奪者將持槍與怪物戰鬥！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Recruits</a> 也將使用重型機槍！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模組現已與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a> 相容！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/730/25/patchouli.png\" alt=\"Patchouli 指南書\" width=\"1094\" height=\"729\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>建議</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此模組為平衡槍械模組，武器與防具的傷害與防禦數值較高。因此建議與其他強化生物的模組一同使用，例如 Consecration、EnhancedAI 與 Mobs Properties Randomness。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>狀態效果</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 混亂</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使生物無法發現目標。若玩家受到此減益效果，則會產生噁心效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">2. 脆弱</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">降低護甲值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">3. 免疫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">幫助你抑制感染，並對不死生物及模組中帶有「undead_mob」標籤（可透過資料包自訂）的怪物造成大量減益效果；但高等級的免疫效果會 <strong>殺死玩家</strong>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">4. 鎮痛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">免疫虛弱、<strong>挖掘疲勞</strong> 與緩速效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">5. 偽裝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">隱藏自身。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">6. 暴露</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">敵人已發現你。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">7. 暈眩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">噢，好痛。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>武器與工具</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 撬棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成緩速效果。右鍵可撬開門與箱子。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 棒球棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">橫掃攻擊，並擊退生物。但傷害與耐久度較低。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 開山刀</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">橫掃攻擊，類似劍。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 消防斧</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成極高傷害並附加脆弱效果，但攻擊速度非常慢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 匕首</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害低但攻擊速度極高。對未攻擊你的敵人右鍵可造成巨大傷害。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">6. 耙子</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">具有更遠的攻擊範圍。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">7. 扳手</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可投擲，蓄力後可使敵人暈眩。放在副手時可用於操作裝置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">8. 膽汁罐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使所有生物陷入混亂狀態。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">9. 藥水罐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">對不死生物及模組中帶有「undead_mob」標籤的生物造成脆弱、緩速與虛弱效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">10. 莫洛托夫雞尾酒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">燃燒一切。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>防具</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 滑雪服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">全套穿戴時提升移動速度，搭配護目鏡免疫失明效果，搭配靴子可在粉雪上行走。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 標準/防暴戰術服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">超級帥氣，並能在特定生態域隱藏玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 防爆服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">犧牲攻擊力與移動速度換取更高的護甲值。全套穿戴時提供生命提升與抗性效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 外骨骼裝甲</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">極度酷炫，且每個部件都會提供一項增益效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>醫療用品</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 繃帶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">治療自身。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 止痛藥</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提供吸收與鎮痛效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 醫療包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">專業醫療工具，可同時用於治療與鎮痛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 奇蹟藥</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">治療感染並提供玩家大量增益效果，且 <strong>增加</strong> 一級免疫等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 可疑藥物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">噢！這真噁心。但或許它能治癒感染？</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>感染系統</strong></span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在，被不死生物近戰攻擊或食用受感染的食物會使你感染。受到的攻擊越多，病情就越嚴重！請好好照顧自己！而你的盔甲能保護你！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">盔甲能減少你受到的感染程度，而盔甲韌性則有助於抵抗感染！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用<strong> /infection</strong> 來設定/查詢玩家的感染等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 40 無特殊效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 70 飢餓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">70 - 90 虛弱、緩速、飢餓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">90 - 99 虛弱 II、緩速、飢餓、失明</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>此外，感染等級會緩慢增加。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">和平模式：每 1600 刻（80 秒）減少 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">簡單模式：低於 40 時每 1600 刻減少 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">普通模式：低於 40 時每 1600 刻減少 1，高於 70 時每 1600 刻增加 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">困難模式：高於 40 時每 1600 刻增加 1</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你也可以使用資料包來設定治療感染的物品。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">帶有「infection_decrease」標籤的物品會減少 15 感染等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">帶有「infection_clear」標籤的物品能治癒玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">帶有「undead_mob」標籤的生物會在近戰攻擊中造成感染。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">帶有「infected_food」標籤的食物會造成 10 級感染。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你可以使用遊戲規則 disableInfection 來停用感染機制。</strong></span></p>\n</div><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>流血系統</strong></span></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在受到傷害不僅會減少生命值，還會造成傷口，使玩家流血。受到的傷害越高，傷口越嚴重。小傷口會隨著時間緩慢癒合，但太嚴重的傷口若不處理會惡化。失血會讓玩家逐漸虛弱，甚至吸引殭屍。因此，傷口需要及時使用醫療用品處理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">遊戲中 HUD 顯示的是 100 - 流血值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 20 你很健康。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">20 - 40 脆弱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 60 脆弱 II、虛弱、暴露和緩速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">60 - 80 脆弱 IV、虛弱 II、暴露和緩速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">80 - 99 脆弱 VI、虛弱 II、暴露和緩速 II。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果你的傷口被包紮好，就不會吸引殭屍。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用遊戲規則 disablebleed 來停用流血機制。</span></strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">其他</span></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">現在襲擊者會與怪物一同攻擊！</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>未來計畫：</strong></span></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多藥品（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">陷阱（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">十字弓</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">EXO 裝備充電，更多 EXO 裝備能力</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多迷彩樣式（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">電鋸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">感染系統（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Patchouli 手冊（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">任何好的點子</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>貢獻者</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Konn_gara</strong> - 程式</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Kyoko</strong> - 美術</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>阿琦</strong> - 美術</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>白久谷</strong> - 模型</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>IronCurtain</strong> - 模型</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>lan2418</strong> - 翻譯</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>軒影LHXQing</strong> - 結構</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Scarasol</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp; 吉祥物</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>我 Minecraft 伺服器裡的每個人</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>問與答</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>1.Fabric 和其他版本？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 抱歉，因為我同時在開發三個模組，沒有精力將此模組移植到其他版本。不過，我歡迎其他人這麼做。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>2.模組包？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 你可以在非商業用途的伺服器和模組包中使用。商業用途則需要獲得我的許可。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>3.轉載？</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 不行。</span></p>",
